{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Notice: A microphone is required to play this game.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Using Your Voice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Super Shout Showdown</i>, you cast spells by shouting their names \u2014 or chant full incantations to unleash even greater magic. You know...Just like in anime!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The voice recognition system supports many languages, including English, Japanese, Spanish, Korean, Bahasa Indonesia, and more. No matter where you\u2019re from, the magic is always in your hands\u2026 or your voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/34ee8a1df095b4975b3e398bf4ffc1e0.poster.avif?t=1761671941\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/34ee8a1df095b4975b3e398bf4ffc1e0.webm?t=1761671941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/34ee8a1df095b4975b3e398bf4ffc1e0.mp4?t=1761671941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Endless Spell Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover more than 20 unique spells. Cast fireballs, teleport across the field, create a barrier, or unleash a powerful ultimate attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your spells by imbuing it with elemental power: burn foes with fire, freeze them with ice, or blind them with darkness. Experiment, combine, and master them to create your own fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/2da7c06bc90e767d7f90a2402f5ecf9f.poster.avif?t=1761671941\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/2da7c06bc90e767d7f90a2402f5ecf9f.webm?t=1761671941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/2da7c06bc90e767d7f90a2402f5ecf9f.mp4?t=1761671941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duels Battle</strong> \u2013 Fight another player in a one-on-one battle to let them know who's the better spellcaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Battle</strong> \u2013 Fight in 3v3v3 matches. Work together, combo your spells, and strategize to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-for-All</strong> \u2013 Fight with up to 16 players in one big area where danger might comes from every direction.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VRoid Character Integration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the battle with your very own character. The game also supports VRoid character integration \u2014 bring in your custom VRoid models and fight as your very own anime avatar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b9c2250866a0cc17eae8b5dacdd8724c.webp?t=1761671941\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b9c2250866a0cc17eae8b5dacdd8724c.poster.avif?t=1761671941\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011300?t=1761671941","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011300?t=1761671941","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea