gration \u2014 bring in your custom VRoid models and fight as your very own anime avatar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b9c2250866a0cc17eae8b5dacdd8724c.webp?t=1761671941\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b9c2250866a0cc17eae8b5dacdd8724c.poster.avif?t=1761671941\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p>","developers":["Rezero Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/67a37acf18d234d4b585dd9f81e1385865c3783d/header.jpg?t=1761671941","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4011300/1253256904/0c1d587d9beece86eb5b73d8b09f353def502798/1761238512/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761671939","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4011300/1253256904/0c1d587d9beece86eb5b73d8b09f353def502798/1761238512/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761671939","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4011300/1253256904/0c1d587d9beece86eb5b73d8b09f353def502798/1761238512/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761671939","id":257221738,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221738/movie480.mp4?t=1761671939","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221738/movie_max.mp4?t=1761671939"},"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257221738/bb6ddd875d74ae19498380a225b2ed88e7b990b2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761671939","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221738/movie480.webm?t=1761671939","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto